title: Tutorial_Phone_Chat
---
<<set_view chat>>
<<set_cyberdeck_state 1>>
<<wait 0.5>>

Nat: Hiiii, it's your fave roomie!! ^.^ How’s your night going?
Luna: like slop 
Nat: Oh no! I hope you don't think this device I made you is slop too ToT
Luna: chill out, Nat! i like it. but idk how it's different from my old phone tho.
Nat: Hmm have you tried the other features I programmed into it?
Luna: no
Luna: can you walk me thru it again?
Nat: Yes! I'd LOVE to UwU
Nat: Welcome to your very own <b>cyberdeck</b>! It's like your phone, BUT BETTER hehe
Nat: You’re on the <b>Messages</b> screen! Sort through spam, news, and VERY important messages from me.
Nat: <b>Settings</b> lets you tweak things like sound. You can also <b>quit the game</b> from Settings.
Nat: <b>History</b> lets you snoop through old conversations. (It tracks your inner thoughts, too.)
Luna: umm that's creepy?
Nat: Wait waittt I also made a cute little <b>mini-game</b> just for you! Click on the lil monster icon to play it.
Nat: And when you’re done with the cyberdeck? Click <b>Exit</b>! You can always come back by clicking the NATIO 3000 logo.
Luna: thanks. and yea it made sense. can i go back to work now?
Nat: Of course! Holler if you need anything, roomie <3
<<wait_for_cyberdeck_exit>>
<<set_view main>>
<<set_cyberdeck_state 0>>
<<jump Val>>
===